a country called Ma'I.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.450
And while all of these
advancements were happening here

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.620
on these islands, another group of humans

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.330
had been evolving in
another part of the world,

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:30.801
over here in Europe.

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:33.660
