had a different culture,

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:37.293
a different religion.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:40.590
Many of their advancements were achieved

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:43.543
through expansion, not collaboration.

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.293
