when they stomp out others.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.573
They wanted to conquer.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.150
This island, these people,

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:00.900
this culture would soon be swallowed,

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.750
stripped of what made them, them.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.780
