King of their conquerors.

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:12.610
This isn't a story just
about a big powerful military

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.560
taking over new lands.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.290
We know that story pretty well.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:19.520
The story of these people
offers a new perspective

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:21.110
